      "note": "Reviewed the loss receipt and trace, every transfer touching the six pToken reserves and controller, their archive balances, the attacker's immediate nonce history, the oracle creation receipt and trace, historical runtime code, verified PancakeOracle source, proxy slots, and independently preceding DefiLlama prices. The pToken-plus-controller union loses exactly 85 CAKE, 18,000 DOLLY, 18 WETH, 1.6 BTCB, 89,000 USDT, and 90,000 BUSD; internal protocol fee movements cancel, and each whole-block archive delta equals the corresponding receipt-level union outflow. The controller balance gains exactly 8,450 DOP collateral. The loss trace calls PriceFeeds 0x86043747dae9b6dd80c463a29e5b21e50bef5e7d, which calls PancakeOracle 0xa41bf81be90fe9666cd566a80c85871f41529aed; the latter directly reads the DOP/BUSD pair's live reserves. PancakeOracle was top-level created in source-3 at block 9,956,707 index 0, timestamp 1,628,745,818 by 0x74f0c3e2bf15014a8f656c4b2e31b4a3efdf4e1d. Code is absent one block earlier; its 1,373-byte runtime hashes to 0xd4553264fd845aabff57aa9de2657b272994497b1d647acccb81ec6e086199df at creation and pre-incident, and its EIP-1967 implementation, admin and beacon slots are zero. The attacker EOA's nonce 0 creates the helper in source-2 36 seconds before nonce 1 executes the sole loss. Nonces 2 through 7 only withdraw six already-counted assets or residuals from the helper to the EOA; nonce 8 onward approves and swaps them without further victim contact. CAKE, ETH and BTC price observations precede the loss by 526, 652 and 492 seconds."
